{"3507350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Planetiny", "steam_appid": 3507350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Planetiny is an idle incremental game with Desktop Mode for work or study. Discover planets, collect Tinies, upgrade worlds, and replace inefficient inhabitants to grow your galaxy. Adapt it to your mood with chill or lofi music and customizable ambient sound.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DISCOVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/c564ba43f8666526a53f3af9ec09cc39.poster.avif?t=1786031030\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/c564ba43f8666526a53f3af9ec09cc39.webm?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/c564ba43f8666526a53f3af9ec09cc39.mp4?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Unlock up to 5 colorful galaxies and add up to 6 planets in each one. Every planet has unique shapes and hosts one of 18 beautifully crafted landscapes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COLLECT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/92d1635237cb9326d50796cc99f72bc3.poster.avif?t=1786031030\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/92d1635237cb9326d50796cc99f72bc3.webm?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/92d1635237cb9326d50796cc99f72bc3.mp4?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">18 races of Tinies, with 4 rarities and 3 levels each. Build your own cosmic collection with thousands of unique combinations thanks to procedural generation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BOOST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/2c392990b92fcb6a34d5e481736f30d3.poster.avif?t=1786031030\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/2c392990b92fcb6a34d5e481736f30d3.webm?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/2c392990b92fcb6a34d5e481736f30d3.mp4?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Feed Tinies for one-time output boosts. Upgrade planets for permanent increases. Master both to maximize your resource production.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OPTIMIZE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/6066d4e39b00b47db742affa2553bcd6.poster.avif?t=1786031030\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/6066d4e39b00b47db742affa2553bcd6.webm?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/6066d4e39b00b47db742affa2553bcd6.mp4?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sell planets and inefficient Tinies for resources, keep the most efficient ones, and set the pace at which your galaxy grows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DESKTOP MODE &amp; SOUND CUSTOMIZATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/6ecd6e826659a66f56f59815532c67ed.poster.avif?t=1786031030\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/6ecd6e826659a66f56f59815532c67ed.webm?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507350/extras/6ecd6e826659a66f56f59815532c67ed.mp4?t=1786031030\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customize the soundscape and music to match your mood. Activate Desktop Mode to keep Planetiny always visible while you study, work, or do other things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>A tiny galaxy that produces while you do.</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Planetiny is an idle incremental game with Desktop Mode for work or study. Discover planets, collect Tinies, upgrade worlds, and replace inefficient inhabitants to grow your galaxy. Adapt it to your mood with chill or lofi music and customizable ambient sound.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>DISCOVER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay